## Write a programme to check whether the sides of a triangle a,b,c form a right angled traingle or not.


a=int(input("Enter the side of traingle:"))
b=int(input("Enter the side of triangle:"))
c=int(input("Enter the side of traingle:"))

if a>=b and a>=c:
    hypotenuse=a
    side1=b
    side2=c
elif b>=a and b>=c:
    hypotenuse=b
    side1=a
    side2=c
else:
    hypotenuse=c
    side1=a
    side2=b

if side1**2 + side2**2 == hypotenuse**2:
    print("This triangle is for sure a right-angled triangle")
else:
    print("This is not a right angled traingle")

    
